 <div class="terms">
  <div><b>You own everything from day one</b>Website, ad accounts, data. You pay the ad platforms directly through your own accounts. We never mark up ad spend.</div>
  <div><b>One roofing company per market</b>Defined in writing at signing, so you never compete with our other clients for the same homeowners.</div>
